      "created": 1792321727011,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AWS infrastructure (Terraform)\n\nVPC + internet gateway\nPublic subnet: both EC2 instances\nPrivate subnet: provisioned\nSeparate persistent Elastic IP per hostname\nSecurity groups + SSM instance profiles\nDedicated k3s IAM role: Route 53 zone access\nIMDSv2: pods can use the k3s instance role",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AWS infrastructure (Terraform)\n\nVPC + internet gateway\nPublic subnet: both EC2 instances\nPrivate subnet: provisioned\nSeparate persistent Elastic IP per hostname\nSecurity groups + SSM instance profiles\nDedicated k3s IAM role: Route 53 zone access\nIMDSv2: pods can use the k3s instance role",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
