      "updated": 1792337995040,
      "created": 1792321727011,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "salt.ergoshear.dev | persistent Elastic IP\nFedora 44 arm64 | t4g.small\n\nSalt minion ID / runner: salt-master-01\nsalt-master + salt-minion + SSM agent\nMaster serves runner checkout: salt/ + pillar/\nMaster scheduler: all-minion highstate / 5 min\nCommon states: packages + TuneD aws profile\n\nReceives k3s token via cp.push (file_recv)\nExternal pillar reads master cache token\nK3S_TOKEN available to all authenticated minions",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "salt.ergoshear.dev | persistent Elastic IP\nFedora 44 arm64 | t4g.small\n\nSalt minion ID / runner: salt-master-01\nsalt-master + salt-minion + SSM agent\nMaster serves runner checkout: salt/ + pillar/\nMaster scheduler: all-minion highstate / 5 min\nCommon states: packages + TuneD aws profile\n\nReceives k3s token via cp.push (file_recv)\nExternal pillar reads master cache token\nK3S_TOKEN available to all authenticated minions",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
