      "created": 1792321727011,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "k3s.ergoshear.dev | persistent Elastic IP\nFedora 44 arm64 | t4g.medium\n\nSalt minion ID / runner: k3s-control-plane-01\nk3s server + salt-minion + SSM agent\nSalt installs k3s, kubectl, Helm, Kustomize\nControl-plane taint: NoSchedule\nApproved platform pods tolerate the taint\n\nArgo CD namespace: argocd\nKustomize deploys Argo CD via GitHub Actions\nNo apps/ auto-sync or deploy key configured\n\nIngress: Traefik + k3s ServiceLB (80/443)\nExternalDNS v0.23: TXT ownership + sync\ncert-manager v1.21.2: Route 53 DNS-01\nLet's Encrypt ClusterIssuer + TLS certificate\nTraefik terminates TLS; Argo CD uses HTTP\nKubernetes API 6443: home CIDR only",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "k3s.ergoshear.dev | persistent Elastic IP\nFedora 44 arm64 | t4g.medium\n\nSalt minion ID / runner: k3s-control-plane-01\nk3s server + salt-minion + SSM agent\nSalt installs k3s, kubectl, Helm, Kustomize\nControl-plane taint: NoSchedule\nApproved platform pods tolerate the taint\n\nArgo CD namespace: argocd\nKustomize deploys Argo CD via GitHub Actions\nNo apps/ auto-sync or deploy key configured\n\nIngress: Traefik + k3s ServiceLB (80/443)\nExternalDNS v0.23: TXT ownership + sync\ncert-manager v1.21.2: Route 53 DNS-01\nLet's Encrypt ClusterIssuer + TLS certificate\nTraefik terminates TLS; Argo CD uses HTTP\nKubernetes API 6443: home CIDR only",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
