      "text": "User HTTPS request\nargocd.ergoshear.dev -> CNAME k3s.ergoshear.dev -> Elastic IP :443 -> ServiceLB -> Traefik -> argocd-server\nTLS: publicly trusted Let's Encrypt certificate; automatic DNS-01 renewal (not ACM; no AWS ALB/controller)",
